WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.710
Hello there.

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.712
Now I know what you're
thinking.

00:00:03.712 --> 00:00:05.464
Crikey, a black cat!

00:00:05.464 --> 00:00:07.716
He's gonna bring me bad luck.

00:00:07.716 --> 00:00:09.885
Shows what you know about luck.

00:00:10.302 --> 00:00:15.140
♪♪

00:00:15.140 --> 00:00:16.433
Let's drop some knowledge.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:19.269
Luck is different all around the
world.

00:00:19.353 --> 00:00:23.565
Like in Scotland... where a
black cat like me is considered
very lucky.

00:00:23.899 --> 00:00:26.193
Remember kids, don't try this at
home.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.403
Names Bob, by the way.

00:00:28.612 --> 00:00:31.031
And this is the land of luck.

00:00:31.698 --> 00:00:32.407
Morning, Gerry.

00:00:33.116 --> 00:00:35.202
We work behind the scenes to
create those

00:00:35.202 --> 00:00:38.956
wee lucky and unlucky moments
that make up your every day
life.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:43.710
Like these guys, an entire team
thinking up the jammie work.

00:00:44.002 --> 00:00:46.588
That kinda makes you feel like
a million bucks.

00:00:46.588 --> 00:00:47.214
(Cheering)

00:00:47.214 --> 00:00:48.840
Okay, maybe a hundred bucks.

00:00:49.216 --> 00:00:51.260
Of course then there's the other
team.

00:00:51.802 --> 00:00:54.179
Working on the not so jammie
kind of luck.

00:00:54.179 --> 00:00:56.848
And they sure love what they do.

00:00:57.975 --> 00:01:00.978
Well, you humans are a
complicated lot.

00:01:00.978 --> 00:01:03.188
And that's why things run so
smoothly here.

00:01:03.188 --> 00:01:06.316
Because no human has ever
stepped foot in this place.

00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:08.902
And with a little bit luck, they
never will.

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:09.695
(Bang)
Oww!

00:01:10.195 --> 00:01:13.907
(Crash sounds)

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:16.410
Uh, where am I?

00:01:17.577 --> 00:01:19.913
Oh, you got to be kidding.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:27.629
♪♪

00:01:27.629 --> 00:01:28.672
(Chuckles)

00:01:28.672 --> 00:01:29.464
(Sigh)
Hmm.

